OL,3,AChina issues Mount Fuji warning as
OL,4,Afamily of missing climber offers reward
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chinese embassy in Japan has warned
OL,7,Fits citizens against off-season ascents
OL,8,Fof Mount Fuji amid concerns that the
OL,9,Fhefty reward offered by a missing
OL,10,Fhiker's family could encourage more
OL,11,Freckless climbing.
OL,13,FChen Jie, 25, vanished on 8 November on
OL,14,Fthe mountain. His family is offering
OL,15,F500,000 yuan ($75,000; #57,300) to
OL,16,Fanyone who finds him alive, and 100,000
OL,17,Fyuan to anyone who recovers his body,
OL,18,Fsay Chinese and Japanese media reports.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
